            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-xxl",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<p>When movement meets clean air, something powerful happens. That’s exactly what unfolded during a recent partnership between Blueair, a global leader in air wellness, and The Class (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.theclass.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Join a class\">Join a class<\/a>), the transformative movement and mindfulness practice known for its emotionally cathartic and physically demanding sessions.<\/p><p>As the official air wellness partner for The Class’s flagship studio, Blueair integrated its advanced air wellness products—including the new Blue Signature™—to deliver a fresh, high-performing environment where breath, movement, and presence came together.<\/p><p>This collaboration highlighted how non-toxic living, clean air, and somatic wellness experiences like The Class are shaping the future of the modern mind and body retreat.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_KnqYBR": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
