            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>When Breath Fuels Movement<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>The Class is known for guiding participants through dynamic, music-driven classes that help release stored tension and re-regulate the nervous system. With Blueair's HEPASilent™ air purification technology in the space, every inhale became an intentional, nourishing part of the experience.<\/p><p>Blue Signature™ air purifiers worked quietly in the background, filtering out airborne pollutants, allergens, and odors to support clearer breathing, better focus, and improved recovery. The result was a subtle yet transformative shift in how participants felt—physically, mentally, and emotionally.<\/p><p>“It’s subtle, but powerful. You don’t see it working; you just feel better being in the space,” said Soeuraya Wilson, teacher at The Class.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "text_Ub47yL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>A Shared Vision for Non-Toxic Living and Whole-Body Wellness<\/h4><p><\/p><p>Today’s wellness seekers are more aware than ever of the importance of non-toxic living and clean indoor environments—especially in high-traffic spaces like fitness studios, homes, and yoga and wellness retreats. Clean air is no longer a luxury—it’s essential to the overall wellness equation.<\/p><p>Blueair and The Class shared a belief that breath is at the center of well-being. With research showing links between air quality and benefits like better sleep, stronger immunity, and improved mental clarity, the collaboration offered more than just a cleaner space—it elevated the entire experience.<\/p><p><\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
