            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>The Blue Signature™ Difference<\/h4><p><\/p><p>The Blue Signature™ air purifier is engineered to clean large spaces—up to 3,390 square feet in just one hour—making it ideal for wellness studios, home sanctuaries, and eco-conscious retreats. During the partnership, the studio was outfitted with Blueair devices that supported deeper breathing and helped students move through their practice with greater ease and focus.<\/p><p>Guests had the opportunity to experience the Blue Signature ™  line firsthand, scan to learn more, and even take home exclusive offers—bringing air wellness into their personal routines.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
