            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Clean Air as a Cornerstone of Wellness Spaces<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Whether in a dynamic movement class, a serene yoga and wellness retreat, or the comfort of a home, clean air supports deeper connection to self and environment. This collaboration illustrated how thoughtful design, science-backed products, and a commitment to mind-body wellness can transform even a single breath into a moment of healing.<\/p><p>From boutique fitness spaces to full-scale wellness retreats like Haven Wellness, the message is clear: air matters.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
